1
) would state: “The notice described in paragraph (c)(6)(v)(A) of this section must also include notice of the revocation, the reason(s) for the revocation, and a description of the prescriber's appeal rights concerning the revocation.”

++ New § 423.120(c)(6)(v)(B)(
