1
)(
i
) would state: “If the prescriber does not file a reconsideration request under § 498.5(n)(1) of this chapter, the prescriber will be added to the preclusion list upon the expiration of the 60-day period in which the prescriber may request a reconsideration; or”.

++ New § 423.120(c)(6)(v)(C)(
1
)(
ii
